  "post_title": "Este jueves comienza la IX Ruta de la Tapa de Hosturionda, que ya tiene nueva presidenta, Lidia Peris",
  "post_date": "2019-11-13 22:18:18",
  "post_name": "este-jueves-comienza-la-ix-ruta-de-la-tapa-de-hosturionda-que-ya-tiene-nueva-presidenta-lidia-peris",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Economía|Noticias|Sociedad|Turismo",
  "post_content": "<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\">(24 fotos) Hosturionda organiza, un a&ntilde;o m&aacute;s, la IX ruta de la Tapa, que en esta ocasi&oacute;n se desarrollar&aacute; desde este jueves, 14 de noviembre, al domingo 1 de diciembre.</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2019/11/IMG_3079.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\">Este a&ntilde;o participan 18 locales:</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\">Pura Magia</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\">Cervantes Gastrobar</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\">Bocateria El Cant&oacute;</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\">El Delantal Verde</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\">L&#39;Antiga C&agrave;mara</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\">Bolera Contrastes</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\">Briet&#39;s Gastrobar</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\">Cerveseria Ca Panera</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\">Pla Gastrobar</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\">Classics Bistro</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\">Man&aacute; Bar</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\">Donde Mar&iacute;a Jos&eacute;</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\">Rinc&oacute;n Andaluz</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\">El Caf&eacute; del Banc</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\">Caf&eacute; Passatge</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\">Rte. Com a Casa</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\">Campus Espai d&#39;Oci</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\">Rte. Claxon</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2019/11/TapaRuta.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 341px;\" /></div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\">El precio de tapa + bebida es de 3.50 &euro; y habr&aacute; 400 &euro; en premios, que se repartir&aacute;n en un primer premio de 250 &euro;, a sortear entre quienes completen la ruta al completo y un segundo premio de 150 &euro; entre todas aquellas personas que superen el 80% de la misma.</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\">Se votar&aacute; a trav&eacute;s de la web&nbsp;<a data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=http://www.hosturionda.es&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1573764803997000&amp;usg=AFQjCNE-W5rrIQY02JJBmcRvCIMiS70BSQ\" href=\"http://www.hosturionda.es/\" rel=\"noreferrer noreferrer\" style=\"color: rgb(17, 85, 204);\" target=\"_blank\">www.hosturionda.es</a>&nbsp;y habr&aacute; tres opciones de voto, Muy bien, bien y regular. Para poder efectuar el voto se entregar&aacute; un c&oacute;digo con cada tapa consumida.</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\">El d&iacute;a de la presentaci&oacute;n de las tapas, como la</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2019/11/TapaDondeMariaJose.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\">de D&oacute;nde Mar&iacute;a Jos&eacute;,</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2019/11/TapaManaBar.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\">Man&aacute; Bar o</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2019/11/TapaBriets-1.jpeg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 317px;\" /></div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\">Briet&#39;s Gastrobar, tambi&eacute;n se realiz&oacute; el concurso, cuyo resultado se dar&aacute; a conocer cuando finalice la ruta.</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2019/11/IMG_3110.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\">Tambi&eacute;n se le hizo un homenaje a Carmen Badenes Alarc&oacute;n, del Bar Bah&iacute;a, recientemente jubilada.</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\">A continuaci&oacute;n se celebr&oacute; la asamblea para elegir a quien relevara a Javier Lozar Mu&ntilde;oz, chef del restaurant Toledo, en la presidencia. Hubo dos candidaturas y obtuvo m&aacute;s votos Lidia Peris, de Sargantana Aventura, que queda como presidenta. Jes&uacute;s Palacios, de Caf&eacute; Colonial, es el vicepresidente, al quedar en segundo lugar en la votaci&oacute;n.</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\"></div>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenrutatapa2019/img_3079.jpg\" alt=\"img_3079\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenrutatapa2019/img_3081.jpg\" alt=\"img_3081\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenrutatapa2019/img_3083.jpg\" alt=\"img_3083\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenrutatapa2019/img_3086.jpg\" alt=\"img_3086\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenrutatapa2019/img_3088.jpg\" alt=\"img_3088\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenrutatapa2019/img_3090.jpg\" alt=\"img_3090\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenrutatapa2019/img_3091.jpg\" alt=\"img_3091\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenrutatapa2019/img_3093.jpg\" alt=\"img_3093\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenrutatapa2019/img_3094.jpg\" alt=\"img_3094\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenrutatapa2019/img_3100.jpg\" alt=\"img_3100\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenrutatapa2019/img_3101.jpg\" alt=\"img_3101\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenrutatapa2019/img_3103.jpg\" alt=\"img_3103\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenrutatapa2019/img_3107.jpg\" alt=\"img_3107\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenrutatapa2019/img_3108.jpg\" alt=\"img_3108\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenrutatapa2019/img_3109.jpg\" alt=\"img_3109\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenrutatapa2019/img_3110.jpg\" alt=\"img_3110\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenrutatapa2019/img_3113.jpg\" alt=\"img_3113\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenrutatapa2019/img_3115.jpg\" alt=\"img_3115\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenrutatapa2019/tapabriets-1.jpg\" alt=\"tapabriets-1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenrutatapa2019/tapabriets-1_0.jpg\" alt=\"tapabriets-1_0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenrutatapa2019/tapabriets-2.jpg\" alt=\"tapabriets-2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenrutatapa2019/tapadondemariajose.jpg\" alt=\"tapadondemariajose\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenrutatapa2019/tapamanabar.jpg\" alt=\"tapamanabar\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenrutatapa2019/taparuta.jpg\" alt=\"taparuta\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
